# Example edge-function secrets for `supabase secrets set --env-file`.
# Copy it OUTSIDE the repo (SETUP.md uses ~/clozr-secrets/functions.env) and
# fill in your own values. Never commit the filled-in copy.
#
# Google OAuth: the values below are DUMMIES and will not work. Create your own
# OAuth client (type: Web application) in your own Google Cloud project, per
# SETUP.md step 10. If your real client secret is ever committed or shared,
# reset it in Google Cloud (Credentials, your client, Reset secret).
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=000000000000-dummyclientid.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-DUMMY-SECRET-not-a-real-credential
# GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=https://crm.yourcompany.com/oauth/google/callback
# GOOGLE_TOKEN_KEY=
